WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.934 --> 00:00:19.264
Bird was in her nest.

2
00:00:19.265 --> 00:00:29.015
She was looking at something.

3
00:00:29.016 --> 00:00:32.849
"What are you doing, Bird?" asked Kip.

4
00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:39.059
"I'm looking at my stamp collection," said Bird.

5
00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:43.054
"I didn't know you like stamps," said Kip.

6
00:00:43.055 --> 00:00:53.973
"Yes, I like stamps a lot," said Bird.

7
00:00:53.974 --> 00:01:03.613
"Some of these are pretty dusty," said Bird.

8
00:01:03.614 --> 00:01:11.116
"I haven't looked at them in a while."

9
00:01:11.117 --> 00:01:18.886
"They have nice colors," said Kip.

10
00:01:18.887 --> 00:01:25.379
"And they have neat pictures."

11
00:01:25.380 --> 00:01:31.704
"Cool! An airplane," said Kip.

12
00:01:31.705 --> 00:01:36.563
"Here's one with a moon," said Bird.

13
00:01:36.564 --> 00:01:44.542
"I like these turtles," said Kip.

14
00:01:44.543 --> 00:01:51.499
"Hey, look! I see a chipmunk!"

15
00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:59.150
"This stamp is my favorite," said Bird.

16
00:01:59.151 --> 00:02:05.646
"It has a bird.

17
00:02:05.647 --> 00:02:15.059
Doesn't it look just like me?"

18
00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:17.729
"Yes, Bird" said Kip.

19
00:02:17.730 --> 00:02:21.382
"That bird does look like . . .

20
00:02:21.383 --> 00:02:30.464
Ah . . . ah . . . ah-choo!"
